\",\"__typename\":\"ImageType\"},{\"url\":\"https://qademovc3.blob.core.windows.net/catalog/c1959/NGS-75980751/15387445-7-3512114.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"ImageType\"},{\"url\":\"https://qademovc3.blob.core.windows.net/catalog/c1959/NGS-75980751/15387445-8-617E461.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"ImageType\"},{\"url\":\"https://qademovc3.blob.core.windows.net/catalog/c1959/NGS-75980751/15387445-9-758E166.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"ImageType\"},{\"url\":\"https://qademovc3.blob.core.windows.net/catalog/c1959/NGS-75980751/15387445-10-5285652.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"ImageType\"},{\"url\":\"https://qademovc3.blob.core.windows.net/catalog/c1959/NGS-75980751/15387445-11-496AC66.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"ImageType\"},{\"url\":\"https://qademovc3.blob.core.windows.net/catalog/c1959/NGS-75980751/15387445-12-22388F4.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"ImageType\"},{\"url\":\"https://qademovc3.blob.core.windows.net/catalog/c1959/NGS-75980751/15387445-13-126D05D.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"ImageType\"},{\"url\":\"https://qademovc3.blob.core.windows.net/catalog/c1959/NGS-75980751/15387445-14-6E20102.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"ImageType\"},{\"url\":\"https://qademovc3.blob.core.windows.net/catalog/c1959/NGS-75980751/15387445-15-EC9A6CF.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"ImageType\"}],\"description\":{\"content\":\"Park side perfection\\n\\n18e/481 St Kilda Road for Sale\\nThis lavishly appointed, impeccably designed two-level sub-penthouse offers an unparalleled living experience with breathtaking 270-degree views stretching from Port Phillip Bay to the city skyline. Nestled adjacent to the sprawling green landscape of Fawkner Park, this opulent residence provides an exclusive resort-style lifestyle with the convenience of lock-up-and-leave living.\\n\\nUpon entering, you are greeted by marble floors that seamlessly flow through the spacious foyer into the sumptuous formal sitting and dining room. Expansive windows frame spectacular views of Port Phillip Bay, Albert Park Lake, the city, and Fawkner Park. The living area extends to a generous northeast-facing terrace featuring a granite bar, BBQ, and sun awnings, creating an ideal outdoor entertaining space overlooking Fawkner Park.\\n\\nAdjacent to the living area is a versatile space that can serve as a living or media room, connected to a casual dining area and an exquisite kitchen adorned with stone benches, Miele appliances, and a Vintec wine fridge. A marble staircase leads to the upper level, where you'll find the luxurious main bedroom complete with a retreat, fitted study, lavish ensuite, and dressing room. Two additional bedrooms with ensuites and robes provide ample accommodation.\\n\\nSituated in a coveted location within walking distance to South Yarra shops, restaurants, Prahran market, elite schools, trams to the city, Arts Precinct, and Albert Park Lake, this residence is equipped with heating/cooling, video intercom, Bose audio, ducted vacuum, a powder room, laundry, and two car spaces. Residents also enjoy access to \\\"Parkside's\\\" amenities, including a gym, outdoor heated pool, saunas, tennis court, and 24-hour concierge services.\",\"__typename\":\"DescriptionType\"},\"availabilityData\":{\"isActive\":true,\"isAvailable\":true,\"isBuyable\":true,\"isInStock\":true,\"availableQuantity\":0,\"__typename\":\"AvailabilityData\"},\"price\":{\"currency\":\"USD\",\"actual\":{\"amount\":450000.00,\"formattedAmount\":\"$450,000.00\",\"formattedAmountWithoutCurrency\":\"450,000.00\",\"currency\":{\"code\":\"USD\",\"symbol\":\"$\",\"__typename\":\"CurrencyType\"},\"__typename\":\"MoneyType\"},\"discountAmount\":{\"amount\":0.0,\"formattedAmount\":\"$0.00\",\"__typename\":\"MoneyType\"},\"sale\":{\"amount\":450000.00,\"formattedAmount\":\"$450,000.00\",\"__typename\":\"MoneyType\"},\"list\":{\"amount\":450000.00,\"formattedAmount\":\"$450,000.00\",\"formattedAmountWithoutCurrency\":\"450,000.00\",\"currency\":{\"code\":\"USD\",\"symbol\":\"$\",\"__typename\":\"CurrencyType\"},\"__typename\":\"MoneyType\"},\"discountPercent\":0.0,\"__